# GLIMMER offensive-language blocklist (ROT13-encoded).
#
# Used by `glimmer data prepare` to drop paragraphs from public-domain historical texts that
# contain racial slurs. Entries are ROT13-encoded so the terms are not displayed when browsing
# the repository; decode with any ROT13 tool. Matching is case-insensitive and whole-word.
# One entry per line; lines starting with '#' are comments.
